OL,3,GNEWSAFundraisers gear up for Children
OL,4,Ain Need challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren and teachers are set to
OL,7,Fcomplete a running challenge as part of
OL,8,Fthis year's efforts to fundraise for
OL,9,FChildren in Need.
OL,11,FInspired by the number 26, Perranporth
OL,12,FCommunity School reception teacher Amy
OL,13,FWilliamson and Year 3 teacher Laura
OL,14,FPryor were each running a half marathon
OL,15,Fby clocking up 26 miles between them to
OL,16,Farrive at school in time for assembly.
OL,18,FMarine Academy in Plymouth is also
OL,19,Fhosting BBC Devon as teachers there
OL,20,Fcomplete a 26-hour run on the treadmill
OL,21,Ffor the charity.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
